[[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF position, then disconnect the negative battery terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Undo the nuts (1a) and remove the control unit protection (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014632.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections (1a) and (1b) from the\ninjection/ignition system control unit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Engine management ECU</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236797\">M10A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Engine management ECU</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236809\">M10B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014633.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolt (1a) and remove the bracket (1b) securing the fuel\ninjection/ignition control unit.</p><p>2. Remove the fuel injection/ignition control unit, withdrawing\nit from its support.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014634.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>If the injection/ignition control\nunit is replaced, initialise the new control unit \n                                                               <a href=\"#/3237743\">1056F81</a>\n                                                                .</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Refit the fuel injection/ignition control\nunit in its seating and secure it with its bolt.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\nfuel injection/ignition control unit.</p><p>Place the control unit protection back\nin its housing and secure it using the bolts.</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p>"]]